          ItemBox[
           PaneBox[
            
            StyleBox["\<\"FracCorrect[fraction, time] corrects the signal \
fraction calculated with the IVIM model for tissue relaxation and acquisition \
parameters.\\nAfter correction the signal fraction can be regarded as volume \
fraction.\\nFracCorrect[{fraction1, fraction2}, time] corrects the signal \
fraction1 and fraction2 from a 3 compartement IVIM model. \\n\\ntime is {{te, \
tr}, {t2t, t21}, {t1t, t11}} or {{te, tr}, {t2t, t21, t22}, {t1t, t11, \
t12}}\\nwhere t2t and t1t are \\\"tissue\\\" relaxation times and t11 t12, \
t21 and t22 the \\\"fluid\\\" relaxation times \\n\\nThe te and tr as well as \
the relaxation times T2 and T1 can be defines in any time unit as long as \
they are consistant for all, e.g. all in ms.\\n\\noutput is the corrected \
fraction maps\"\>", "InformationUsageText",
             StripOnInput->False,
             LineSpacing->{1.5, 1.5, 3.}],
