distribution.\\n\\nSNRMapCalc[{data1,data2}] calcualtes the signal to noise \
ratio from two identical images using MN[data1,data2] / (.5 SQRT[2] \
STDV[data2-data1]).\\n\\nSNRMapCalc[{data1, .. dataN}] calcualtes the signal \
