obtained with GetGyro\\nTimeShiftFid[fid, time, gyro, {gam, eps, f}] aplies a \
linebroadening with linewidth gam using a custom lineshape f to the fid and a \
phase eps that results in eps ppm shift of the spectra.\\n\\nThe linewidth \
